      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TULSI BANNER (2) had the drop on the lead from the squeeze box but wound up strongly to score (22.38) at Gosford in Mix 2/3 over 388m. Goes very well from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. WHERE'S FERNANDO (7) boasts a strong record this journey here with five wins and four minors from 10 tries. Below best last time at Richmond (22.86) in a NG, finishing a 4 length fourth. Can hit the frame with the right run. DESI'S DREAM (1) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind CREEPING TIGER (19.34) in a Grade 4/5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Must be included in calculations. FLAMIN' JOE (3) is always a threat when he races at this journey.",
